// The hosted session as one line of tags — the form the page's harness
// takes (`../../../browser/page.mjs`), which clicks a page's keys for it.
// The gate reads it from this module's stdout, so no tag is ever written
// down in a script.
//
//   emo run script.emo   -> 3,17,4,10,12,18,0,...

println(ui_calculator.script())
